    <item>
      <title>능률적인 프로그래머 - 프로그래머 생산성의 비밀</title>
      <link>https://ezaurum.com/2013/03/%EB%8A%A5%EB%A5%A0%EC%A0%81%EC%9D%B8-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8%EB%9E%98%EB%A8%B8-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8%EB%9E%98%EB%A8%B8-%EC%83%9D%EC%82%B0%EC%84%B1%EC%9D%98-%EB%B9%84%EB%B0%80/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 25 Mar 2013 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
